{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  MAIN CONTACT SECTION - CONTACT FORM & PAGE CONTENT
  =============================================================================
  Complete contact page with form functionality and content display
  - Shopify contact form integration with validation
  - Conditional page title display
  - Rich text content from page settings
  - Form error handling and success messages
  - Responsive form layout with accessibility features
  - Staggered animations for enhanced user experience
{% endcomment %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  MAIN CONTACT CONTAINER
  =============================================================================
  Primary contact page container with responsive layout and animations
  - central: Centers content within page width constraints
  - py-medium: Vertical padding for proper spacing
  - data-cc-animate: JavaScript animation trigger for entrance effects
  - data-cc-animate-delay="0.2s": Staggered animation timing
  - Responsive design that adapts to different screen sizes
{% endcomment %}
<div class="central py-medium" data-cc-animate data-cc-animate-delay="0.2s">
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    CONDITIONAL PAGE TITLE
    =============================================================================
    Optional page title display based on theme editor setting
    - section.settings.show_title: Boolean setting for title visibility
    - feature-header: Consistent heading styling across theme
    - page.title: Page title from Shopify admin settings
    - H1 tag for proper page hierarchy and SEO
  {% endcomment %}
  {% if section.settings.show_title %}
    <h1 class="feature-header">{{ page.title }}</h1>
  {% endif %}

  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    SHOPIFY CONTACT FORM INTEGRATION
    =============================================================================
    Built-in Shopify contact form with comprehensive functionality
    - contact form: Shopify's native contact form system
    - Automatic form submission handling and validation
    - Customer support ticket creation in Shopify admin
    - Form state management (success, errors, initial)
  {% endcomment %}
  {% form 'contact' %}
    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      FORM SUBMISSION SUCCESS STATE
      =============================================================================
      Success message displayed after successful form submission
      - form.posted_successfully?: Boolean for successful submission
      - rte align-center: Rich text styling with center alignment
      - contact.form.post_success: Localized success message
      - Replaces entire form with confirmation message
    {% endcomment %}
    {% if form.posted_successfully? %}
      <div class="rte align-center">
        {{ 'contact.form.post_success' | t }}
      </div>

    {% else %}
      {% comment %}
        =============================================================================
        PAGE CONTENT DISPLAY
        =============================================================================
        Rich text content from page settings
        - rte: Rich text editor styling for consistent typography
        - page.content: Page content from Shopify admin (supports HTML)
        - Displays above contact form for context and information
        - Supports formatted text, images, links, and basic HTML
      {% endcomment %}
      <div class="rte">
        {{ page.content }}
      </div>

      {% comment %}
        =============================================================================
        FORM VALIDATION ERROR DISPLAY
        =============================================================================
        Error messages for form validation failures
        - form.errors: Array of form validation errors
        - errors: CSS class for error styling
        - contact.form.post_error: Localized error message
        - Loops through all validation errors for comprehensive feedback
        - Field name customization for better user experience
      {% endcomment %}
      {% if form.errors %}
        <div class="errors">
          <p>{{ 'contact.form.post_error' | t }}</p>
          {% comment %}
            =============================================================================
            ERROR FIELD LABEL CUSTOMIZATION
            =============================================================================
            Customizes error field labels for better user experience
            - message_label: Localized label for message field
            - replace: 'body' with 'message' for user-friendly display
            - capitalize: Capitalizes field names for consistency
            - form.errors.messages[field]: Error message for specific field
          {% endcomment %}
          {% assign message_label = 'contact.form.message' | t %}
          <ul>
            {% for field in form.errors %}
              <li>{{ field | replace: 'body', message_label | capitalize }} - {{ form.errors.messages[field] }}</li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% comment %}
        =============================================================================
        CONTACT FORM INPUT FIELDS
        =============================================================================
        Form input fields with accessibility and validation
        - form: CSS class for form styling
        - input-row: Container for individual form fields
        - required: CSS class for required field styling
        - aria-label: Accessibility labels for screen readers
        - placeholder: Helper text for form fields
        - Proper input types for validation and mobile keyboards
      {% endcomment %}
      <div class="form">
        {% comment %}
          =============================================================================
          NAME INPUT FIELD
          =============================================================================
          Text input for contact name
          - type="text": Standard text input
          - required: HTML5 validation and CSS styling
          - id="contact_name": Unique identifier for form field
          - name="contact[name]": Form submission field name
          - aria-label: Accessibility label for screen readers
        {% endcomment %}
        <div class="input-row">
          <input aria-label="{{ 'contact.form.name' | t }}" placeholder="{{ 'contact.form.name' | t }}" type="text"
                 class="required" id="contact_name" name="contact[name]"/>
        </div>

        {% comment %}
          =============================================================================
          EMAIL INPUT FIELD
          =============================================================================
          Email input with HTML5 validation
          - type="email": HTML5 email validation and mobile keyboard
          - required: HTML5 validation and CSS styling
          - id="contact_email": Unique identifier for form field
          - name="contact[email]": Form submission field name
          - class="email": Additional email-specific styling
        {% endcomment %}
        <div class="input-row">
          <input aria-label="{{ 'contact.form.email' | t }}" placeholder="{{ 'contact.form.email' | t }}" type="email"
                 class="required" id="contact_email" class="email" name="contact[email]"/>
        </div>

        {% comment %}
          =============================================================================
          MESSAGE TEXTAREA FIELD
          =============================================================================
          Multi-line text input for contact message
          - textarea: Multi-line text input for longer messages
          - required: HTML5 validation and CSS styling
          - id="message": Unique identifier for form field
          - name="contact[body]": Form submission field name (Shopify standard)
          - aria-label: Accessibility label for screen readers
        {% endcomment %}
        <div class="input-row">
          <textarea aria-label="{{ 'contact.form.message' | t }}" placeholder="{{ 'contact.form.message' | t }}"
                    id="message" class="required" name="contact[body]"></textarea>
        </div>

        {% comment %}
          =============================================================================
          FORM SUBMIT BUTTON
          =============================================================================
          Submit button for form submission
          - wide-action: Full-width button styling class
          - type="submit": Triggers form submission
          - value: Button text from localized strings
          - contact.form.send: Localized submit button text
        {% endcomment %}
        <div class="wide-action">
          <input type="submit" value="{{ 'contact.form.send' | t }}"/>
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  {% endform %}
</div>

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  CONTACT SECTION SCHEMA - CONFIGURATION & CUSTOMIZATION
  =============================================================================
  Theme editor configuration for contact section customization
  - name: Section name displayed in theme editor
  - settings: Configurable options for merchants
  - show_title: Toggle for page title visibility
  - default: true for title display by default
  - Minimal configuration for simple contact form functionality
{% endcomment %}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Contact form",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_title",
      "label": "Show page title",
      "default": true
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
